# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-08-03 11:18

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:7
translate italian day0_2a8ebe20:

    # "It has been a few days since I've' checked my e-mail."
    "Sono passati alcuni giorni dall’ultima volta che ho controllato la mia e-mail."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:10
translate italian day0_6ea4ba89:

    # "As soon as I see the message sitting in my inbox, I feel in my gut that something is wrong."
    "Non appena vedo il messaggio nella mia casella di posta in arrivo, sento istintivamente che c’è qualcosa che non va."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:14
translate italian day0_9bd314a2:

    # "Dad is missing? Disappeared? What does that even mean?"
    "Papà è scomparso? Che cosa significa?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:15
translate italian day0_79ff2c19:

    # "I try to call Lisa, but the phone is disconnected. I e-mail back, but don't get a reply."
    "Provo a chiamare Lisa, ma il telefono è disattivato. Rispondo via e-mail, ma non ricevo risposta."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:16
translate italian day0_af17984d:

    # "I need to go home."
    "Devo tornare a casa."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:25
translate italian day0_a3b78350:

    # "TWO DAYS LATER"
    "DUE GIORNI DOPO"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:28
translate italian day0_030e178d:

    # "The Uber driver pulls up in front of my family's house – the house I had grown up in."
    "L’autista di Uber si ferma davanti alla casa della mia famiglia – la casa in cui sono cresciuta."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:29
translate italian day0_949b7226:

    # "I've only been away for three years, but it feels like a lifetime. I barely remember the place, and the things I do remember feel like they had happened to somebody else – like I had dreamed them or seen them in a movie."
    "Sono stata via solo tre anni, ma mi sembra una vita. Ricordo a malapena quel posto, e le cose che ricordo mi sembrano essere successe a qualcun altro – come se le avessi sognate o viste in un film."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:32
translate italian day0_c142ebfa:

    # "After Mom died, my dad had moved us into this house. It was ten years later that he started dating Lisa and she moved in with us, along with her daughter Suzy."
    "Dopo la morte di mamma, mio padre ci aveva trasferiti in questa casa. Dieci anni dopo aveva iniziato a frequentare Lisa, che si era trasferita da noi insieme a sua figlia Suzy."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:33
translate italian day0_4b89f1ac:

    # "Then I moved away a year after that to go to college in Brazil – as far away from this place as I could possibly get."
    "Poi, un anno dopo, mi sono trasferita per andare all’università in Brasile – il più lontano possibile da questo posto."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:34
translate italian day0_5d54d54c:

    # "I didn't leave under the best circumstances either."
    "Non me ne sono andata nemmeno nelle circostanze migliori."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:35
translate italian day0_8f36008b:

    # "It felt like Dad was trying to replace Mom. I know now that I had been acting ridiculous, but I'd said some things that I regret, and I still haven't apologized for it."
    "Mi sembrava che papà stesse cercando di sostituire la mamma. Ora so che mi comportavo in modo ridicolo, ma avevo detto alcune cose di cui mi pento, e non mi sono ancora scusata per questo."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:36
translate italian day0_dcd0e6e9:

    # "And now my dad is missing, and I may never be able to apologize to him."
    "E ora mio padre è scomparso, e forse non potrò mai chiedergli scusa."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:37
translate italian day0_e04098c7:

    # "I need to know what's going on. Step one of that is talking to Lisa."
    "Devo sapere cosa sta succedendo. Il primo passo è parlare con Lisa."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:38
translate italian day0_ae22b1fe:

    # pc "Thanks for the ride."
    pc "Grazie per il passaggio."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:39
translate italian day0_6b2c2e0d:

    # "Uber Driver" "No problem. Good luck with your dad."
    "Uber Driver" "Non c’è problema. Buona fortuna con tuo padre."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:42
translate italian day0_bd06bca7:

    # "I step out of the car, pulling my suitcase behind me – all of my possessions hastily stuffed inside before leaving college and coming home."
    "Scendo dall’auto, trascinandomi dietro la valigia – tutti i miei averi infilati alla bell’e meglio prima di lasciare l’università e tornare a casa."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:43
translate italian day0_ee16e2af:

    # "The Uber Driver gives me a wave before driving away, leaving me standing in the driveway alone."
    "L’autista di Uber mi fa un cenno con la mano prima di allontanarsi, lasciandomi in piedi da sola nel vialetto."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:44
translate italian day0_1d05517b:

    # "The curtain in the front room moves to the side and a shadowed face looks out at me through the dusty glass."
    "La tenda del salotto si sposta di lato e un volto in ombra mi guarda attraverso il vetro impolverato."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:45
translate italian day0_ffa819f6:

    # "A moment later, the front door opens with a creak."
    "Un attimo dopo, la porta d’ingresso si apre con uno scricchiolio."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:49
translate italian day0_b886cbad:

    # sp "[pcname]?"
    sp "[pcname]?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:50
translate italian day0_1dce07cb:

    # pc "Hey Lisa."
    pc "Ehi, Lisa."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:51
translate italian day0_c451ce54:

    # sp "Oh my God, I can't believe you're here."
    sp "Oh mio Dio, non riesco a credere che tu sia qui."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:54
translate italian day0_4794e2ea:

    # "She rushes out of the house and across the lawn towards me, throwing her arms around my back and pulling me into a hug, sobbing lightly against my shoulder."
    "Si precipita fuori di casa e attraversa il prato verso di me, gettandomi le braccia intorno alla schiena e stringendomi in un abbraccio, singhiozzando leggermente contro la mia spalla."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:55
translate italian day0_168a1c2d:

    # "Then she pulls away, tears still in her eyes."
    "Poi si stacca da me, con le lacrime ancora negli occhi."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:59
translate italian day0_d41d8cd9:

    # voice 'voices/lisa_sorry3.wav'
    voice 'voices/lisa_sorry3.wav'

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:60
translate italian day0_b4977ec9:

    # sp "I'm sorry, it's just so good to see you again."
    sp "Mi dispiace, è solo che sono così felice di rivederti."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:61
translate italian day0_ef7640f1:

    # sp "I didn't know if you got my e-mail or not."
    sp "Non sapevo se avessi ricevuto la mia e-mail o meno."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:62
translate italian day0_c351ff73:

    # pc "I tried to call you and message you back, but couldn't get through."
    pc "Ho provato a chiamarti e a risponderti, ma non sono riuscita a mettermi in contatto con te."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:63
translate italian day0_ab5c6be7:

    # sp "I didn't have enough money to keep paying the phone bill, or the internet. I used Suzy's phone to send that message."
    sp "Non avevo abbastanza soldi per continuare a pagare la bolletta del telefono o di Internet. Ho usato il telefono di Suzy per mandarti quel messaggio."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:64
translate italian day0_4aaf53f0:

    # sp "Why don't you come inside? Your room is still just like you left it. "
    sp "Perché non entri? La tua stanza è ancora esattamente come l’hai lasciata. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:65
translate italian day0_63023601:

    # pc "Okay."
    pc "Va bene."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:68
translate italian day0_f0440310:

    # "I look up at the house one more time, hesitating for some reason. "
    "Alzo lo sguardo verso la casa un’ultima volta, esitando per qualche motivo. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:69
translate italian day0_c19f0382:

    # "Everything feels so awkward. Like seeing an old friend that you hadn't talked to since high school after you had both grown up and gone in completely different directions, became different people."
    "Tutto sembra così imbarazzante. È come rivedere un vecchio amico con cui non parlavi dai tempi del liceo, dopo che entrambi siete cresciuti e avete preso strade completamente diverse, diventando persone diverse."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:70
translate italian day0_521dbb9a:

    # "Lisa waits at the door expectantly."
    "Lisa mi aspetta sulla porta con aria trepidante."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:73
translate italian day0_44deb548:

    # sp "Come on."
    sp "Dai."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:74
translate italian day0_7ef33df2:

    # "I follow her inside."
    "La seguo dentro."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:78
translate italian day0_cb8b4dc4:

    # "The house isn't much different than I remembered. Some new decorations, but a lot of the old stuff is still there too."
    "La casa non è molto diversa da come la ricordavo. Qualche nuovo elemento decorativo, ma c’è ancora anche gran parte di quella vecchia."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:80
translate italian day0_f76dd47c:

    # "A doorway to the right leads to the kitchen, with the always-clean white cabinets and wooden countertops."
    "Una porta sulla destra conduce alla cucina, con i mobili bianchi sempre puliti e i piani di lavoro in legno."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:83
translate italian day0_5f5c5eda:

    # "To the left, another doorway goes into the living room, where there are a couple of sofas and a television mounted on the wall across from them."
    "A sinistra, un’altra porta conduce al soggiorno, dove ci sono un paio di divani e un televisore appeso alla parete di fronte."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:84
translate italian day0_7532ecd1:

    # "The furniture is different, the television upgraded, but the photos on the wall are exactly the same as I remember them three years ago."
    "I mobili sono diversi, il televisore è più moderno, ma le foto appese alle pareti sono esattamente le stesse che ricordo di tre anni fa."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:85
translate italian day0_62149b84:

    # "Pictures of me mostly, along with others of my dad and Lisa, a few of Suzy, and even some of my mom."
    "Per lo più foto mie, insieme ad altre di mio padre e Lisa, alcune di Suzy e persino alcune di mia madre."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:89
translate italian day0_dcb39111:

    # "Directly in front of me are the stairs leading up to the second floor, while the hall going past the stairs leads to the door that goes down into the basement where Dad's office is."
    "Proprio di fronte a me ci sono le scale che portano al secondo piano, mentre il corridoio che passa accanto alle scale conduce alla porta che scende nel seminterrato, dove si trova l’ufficio di papà."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:90
translate italian day0_a1a128e4:

    # "There's police tape over the door. I'll have to ask Lisa about that."
    "C’è del nastro della polizia sulla porta. Dovrò chiedere a Lisa di cosa si tratta."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:91
translate italian day0_f27132b3:

    # "Past that, the door to the right goes to the master bedroom and bathroom and the door to the left leads to the laundry room. Then there's a patio door in the back that opens into the back yard."
    "Oltre quella porta, quella a destra conduce alla camera da letto principale e al bagno, mentre quella a sinistra porta alla lavanderia. Poi c’è una portafinestra sul retro che si apre sul giardino."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:94
translate italian day0_1758423e:

    # pc "What's the deal with the police tape?"
    pc "Che cosa significa quel nastro della polizia?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:95
translate italian day0_3089e2b3:

    # sp "Oh, they don't want anybody down there until they get finished going through some of the things that they took."
    sp "Oh, non vogliono che nessuno scenda lì sotto finché non avranno finito di esaminare alcune delle cose che hanno sequestrato."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:96
translate italian day0_78bdaf37:

    # sp "The detective locked the door and took the key with her."
    sp "La detective ha chiuso la porta a chiave e si è portata via la chiave."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:97
translate italian day0_c627e703:

    # pc "Wow. Okay."
    pc "Wow. Ok."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:98
translate italian day0_fec9a6b1:

    # sp "You can go put your bag in your room if you want. I was just finishing up dinner."
    sp "Puoi andare a mettere la borsa in camera tua, se vuoi. Stavo proprio finendo di preparare la cena."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:99
translate italian day0_aef6c125:

    # pc "Oh, don't worry about it. I can just get take-out or something. I know you weren't really prepared for me coming today."
    pc "Oh, non preoccuparti. Posso semplicemente prendere qualcosa da asporto o qualcosa del genere. So che non eri proprio preparata per il mio arrivo oggi."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:100
translate italian day0_c773dfdd:

    # sp "Nonsense. I made chicken fried steak. There's plenty."
    sp "Sciocchezze. Ho preparato una bistecca di pollo fritta. Ce n’è in abbondanza."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:101
translate italian day0_18768229:

    # "Chicken fried steak does sound delicious."
    "La bistecca di pollo fritta sembra davvero deliziosa."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:102
translate italian day0_05d61a38:

    # pc "Okay, I'll just go put these up."
    pc "Ok, vado solo a sistemare queste cose."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:105
translate italian day0_00910cb6:

    # sp "Sounds good. Make yourself comfortable. Suzy will be home soon. I'm sure she'll be excited to see you."
    sp "Mi sembra una buona idea. Mettiti comoda. Suzy tornerà a casa presto. Sono sicura che sarà entusiasta di vederti."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:106
translate italian day0_54c86bd6:

    # "I doubt that. Suzy and I had never really gotten along. I think that she's always been jealous of me, because I'm older and always got to do more interesting things than she did."
    "Ne dubito. Io e Suzy non siamo mai andate davvero d’accordo. Penso che sia sempre stata gelosa di me, perché sono più grande e ho sempre fatto cose più interessanti di lei."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:107
translate italian day0_f84afb0d:

    # "She seems so stuck-up to me. Like she and Lisa are just so much better than me and Dad."
    "A me sembra così presuntuosa. Come se lei e Lisa fossero di gran lunga migliori di me e papà."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:108
translate italian day0_1fb90770:

    # "That was three years ago though, I had to remind myself. People can change. I know I have. Although returning to this place is making old feelings return as well."
    "Ma è successo tre anni fa, ho dovuto ricordarmelo. Le persone possono cambiare. So di essere cambiata io. Anche se tornare in questo posto sta facendo riaffiorare anche vecchi sentimenti."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:109
translate italian day0_d7c1e2c2:

    # "I need to try to give them a chance. To start over. I need to be nice. It would be good for me and for the entire family."
    "Devo provare a dare loro una possibilità. A ricominciare da capo. Devo essere gentile. Sarebbe un bene per me e per tutta la famiglia."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:112
translate italian day0_6834d5ee:

    # "I take my bag up the stairs. My door is to the left, while Suzy's door, which she painted as soon as she moved into the house, is to the right."
    "Porto la mia borsa su per le scale. La mia porta è a sinistra, mentre quella di Suzy, che ha dipinto non appena si è trasferita in casa, è a destra."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:113
translate italian day0_c3457fef:

    # "I open my bedroom door and walk inside."
    "Apro la porta della mia camera ed entro."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:116
translate italian day0_e134735d:

    # "All my junk that had been lying around the room when I left is all put away now, but the decorations are exactly how I had left them."
    "Tutta la mia roba che era sparpagliata per la stanza quando me ne sono andata ora è stata messa a posto, ma le decorazioni sono esattamente come le avevo lasciate."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:117
translate italian day0_81daa922:

    # "Band, movie, and video game posters on the walls. My old laptop and computer desk are in the corner covered in a thin layer of dust."
    "Poster di band, film e videogiochi alle pareti. Il mio vecchio portatile e la scrivania del computer sono nell’angolo, ricoperti da un sottile strato di polvere."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:118
translate italian day0_d3121b8d:

    # "My Queen-sized bed is in the other corner, made up as if it were waiting for me. My nightstand next to it still has my favorite lamp on it as well."
    "Il mio letto queen-size è nell’altro angolo, rifatto come se mi stesse aspettando. Sul comodino accanto c’è ancora la mia lampada preferita."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:119
translate italian day0_5c2ab389:

    # "I look around at the posters and can't help but laugh at myself. I had thought this stuff was so cool. I hadn't even realized how much I'd changed over the few years I'd been away from Skyhill."
    "Mi guardo intorno tra i poster e non posso fare a meno di ridere di me stessa. Pensavo che questa roba fosse davvero fantastica. Non mi ero nemmeno resa conto di quanto fossi cambiata in questi pochi anni in cui sono stata lontana da Skyhill."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:120
translate italian day0_ef69d95d:

    # "I shake my head and put my bag on the dresser nearby that is still full of my clothes that I'd left behind when I moved."
    "Scuoto la testa e appoggio la borsa sul comò lì vicino, che è ancora pieno dei vestiti che avevo lasciato quando mi sono trasferita."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:121
translate italian day0_31c8b952:

    # "I shuffle through some of the clothing before deciding that all this stuff is going to have to get donated. I won't be caught dead wearing these clothes again."
    "Sfoglio un po’ i vestiti prima di decidere che tutta questa roba dovrà essere donata. Non mi farei vedere viva e morta con questi vestiti addosso."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:122
translate italian day0_f0fd0cf7:

    # "If I'm going to stay here for any length of time, the decorations on the wall have to change too."
    "Se ho intenzione di restare qui per un po’ di tempo, anche le decorazioni alle pareti devono cambiare."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:123
translate italian day0_6548a872:

    # "I'm not into these bands at all anymore. Hell, most of them aren't together anymore and the lead singer in that one is in jail over sexual assault charges."
    "Non mi piacciono più per niente queste band. Cavolo, la maggior parte di loro non suona più insieme e il cantante di quella band è in prigione con l’accusa di violenza sessuale."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:124
translate italian day0_f45d7436:

    # "I walk over to that poster and rip it down, ball it up, and toss it into the garbage can."
    "Mi avvicino a quel poster, lo strappo via, lo appallottolo e lo butto nel cestino della spazzatura."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:125
translate italian day0_daf8f563:

    # pc "Screw it."
    pc "Al diavolo."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:126
translate italian day0_1153338c:

    # "I rip the rest of them down too. I need a new start. I'm not the same person that I had been when I lived here before and liked this stuff. I've changed and everything else needs to change too."
    "Strappo via anche tutti gli altri. Ho bisogno di un nuovo inizio. Non sono più la stessa persona che ero quando vivevo qui prima e mi piacevano queste cose. Sono cambiato e anche tutto il resto deve cambiare."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:129
translate italian day0_11cc59ea:

    # "When I've finished, a couple minutes later, the walls are bare and the trash can is full. I'll redecorate later, if I decide to stay."
    "Quando ho finito, un paio di minuti dopo, le pareti sono spoglie e il cestino della spazzatura è pieno. Riarrederei più tardi, se decidessi di restare."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:133
translate italian day0_c85d2e30:

    # "I take the bag out of the trash can and carry it down the stairs, heading towards the back door where I know the outdoor bins are kept."
    "Tiro fuori il sacchetto dal cestino e lo porto giù per le scale, dirigendomi verso la porta sul retro dove so che si trovano i bidoni esterni."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:134
translate italian day0_c7469e66:

    # "I'd done this same routine every week growing up. Taking out the garbage was always one of the chores that I did for my weekly $20 allowance."
    "Da bambino facevo questa stessa routine ogni settimana. Portare fuori la spazzatura era sempre una delle faccende che svolgevo in cambio della mia paghetta settimanale di 20 dollari."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:135
translate italian day0_b9ad02f6:

    # "Lisa calls from the kitchen as I pass."
    "Lisa mi chiama dalla cucina mentre passo."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:136
translate italian day0_15b806ca:

    # sp "Where are you going? Not leaving already are you?"
    sp "Dove stai andando? Non te ne stai già andando, vero?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:137
translate italian day0_b5e60a63:

    # pc "Just taking out the garbage. I'll be right back."
    pc "Vado solo a portare fuori la spazzatura. Torno subito."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:138
translate italian day0_c85b3c7e:

    # "I walk past the basement door, past the door leading into my dad's and Lisa's room, and out the back door."
    "Supero la porta del seminterrato, quella che conduce nella camera di mio padre e di Lisa, ed esco dalla porta sul retro."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:141
translate italian day0_f2d37ac4:

    # "The back yard is a mess. One of the fence pickets is down, there are patches of weeds everywhere, and the grass is up past my knees, as if nobody has mowed it in months."
    "Il giardino sul retro è un disastro. Una delle stecche della recinzione è caduta, ci sono ciuffi di erbacce ovunque e l’erba mi arriva oltre le ginocchia, come se nessuno la falciasse da mesi."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:142
translate italian day0_f94bb3ce:

    # "I walk around to where the trashcans are, behind the garage. They're overflowing with garbage as if somebody had forgotten to take them out to the curb last week... and maybe the week before that as well."
    "Faccio il giro fino a dove si trovano i bidoni della spazzatura, dietro al garage. Sono traboccanti di rifiuti, come se qualcuno avesse dimenticato di portarli sul marciapiede la settimana scorsa… e forse anche quella prima."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:143
translate italian day0_12d3e32e:

    # "I sit the trash bag on top of the bin, making a mental note to ask when trash pick-up is, so that I can be sure to get it out. "
    "Appoggio il sacco della spazzatura sopra il bidone, prendendomi mentalmente nota di chiedere quando c’è la raccolta dei rifiuti, così da essere sicura di portarlo fuori in tempo. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:144
translate italian day0_734ac1ca:

    # "I guess Lisa has been a bit distracted with my missing dad."
    "Immagino che Lisa sia stata un po’ distratta dalla scomparsa di mio padre."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:145
translate italian day0_0a4deb90:

    # "???" "[pcname]? Is that you?"
    "???" "[pcname]? Sei tu?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:150
translate italian day0_13302e89:

    # "I look over to where the voice came from and see a face watching me through the gap in the wooden fence on the other side of the yard."
    "Guardo nella direzione da cui proveniva la voce e vedo un volto che mi osserva attraverso la fessura nella staccionata di legno dall’altra parte del giardino."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:151
translate italian day0_82512aa5:

    # pc "Jamie?"
    pc "Jamie?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:152
translate italian day0_c324c938:

    # "Jamie had been my neighbor for years growing up. We played together in the yard when we were young and were good friends all the way through junior high."
    "Jamie era stata la mia vicina per anni durante l’infanzia. Giocavamo insieme in cortile quando eravamo piccoli e siamo stati buoni amici per tutto il periodo delle medie."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:153
translate italian day0_66d7d185:

    # "Then we started hanging out with different crowds when we went to high school and never really kept up with each other after that, aside from nods as we passed in the hall."
    "Poi, quando siamo andati al liceo, abbiamo iniziato a frequentare gruppi diversi e da allora non ci siamo più tenuti in contatto, a parte qualche cenno di saluto quando ci incrociavamo nei corridoi."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:154
translate italian day0_d75b5d1b:

    # "I walk through the overgrown grass to the fence to talk to her."
    "Attraverso l’erba incolta fino alla staccionata per parlarle."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:158
translate italian day0_d41d8cd9_1:

    # voice "voices/jamie_001.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_001.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:159
translate italian day0_c579b7b0:

    # gnd "I'm surprised you remembered my name."
    gnd "Mi sorprende che ti sia ricordata il mio nome."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:160
translate italian day0_59b86f08:

    # pc "We were friends for years, Jamie! I'm not going to forget your name. How have you been?"
    pc "Siamo stati amici per anni, Jamie! Non dimenticherò mai il tuo nome. Come stai?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:163
translate italian day0_21d6813b:

    # gnd "Oh, pretty good. You know, just going to college and still living here."
    gnd "Oh, abbastanza bene. Sai, vado all’università e vivo ancora qui."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:164
translate italian day0_975b1fd3:

    # gnd "What about you? I thought you were going to school in Brazil or something?"
    gnd "E tu? Pensavo che frequentassi l’università in Brasile o qualcosa del genere?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:165
translate italian day0_a95318dd:

    # pc "I was. I finished my third year there and was planning on staying to graduate, but this stuff with my dad happened."
    pc "È vero. Ho finito il terzo anno lì e avevo intenzione di restare per laurearmi, ma poi è successa quella storia con mio padre."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:168
translate italian day0_e16cc8f9:

    # gnd "Oh yeah, I heard about that. They still don't know what happened to him?"
    gnd "Oh sì, ne ho sentito parlare. Non sanno ancora cosa gli sia successo?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:169
translate italian day0_35917d41:

    # pc "I don't think so. I just got here and haven't really started looking into it. Trying to settle in first, you know?"
    pc "Non credo. Sono appena arrivato e non ho ancora iniziato a informarmi. Sto cercando di ambientarmi prima, capisci?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:170
translate italian day0_58eca7fc:

    # gnd "I understand."
    gnd "Capisco."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:171
translate italian day0_78191689:

    # "We stand there for a moment in awkward silence. It's hard to have a normal conversation with the cloud of my missing father looming over our heads."
    "Restiamo lì per un attimo in un silenzio imbarazzante. È difficile avere una conversazione normale con l’ombra di mio padre scomparso che incombe sulle nostre teste."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:174
translate italian day0_8fa47015:

    # gnd "We should go grab a coffee sometime and catch up."
    gnd "Dovremmo andare a prendere un caffè qualche volta e aggiornarci."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:182
translate italian neighborsure_eb2314d3:

    # pc "Sure, I'd like that."
    pc "Certo, mi farebbe piacere."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:186
translate italian neighborsure_d41d8cd9:

    # voice "voices/jamie_002.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_002.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:187
translate italian neighborsure_59e12605:

    # gnd "Great! I'm looking forward to it."
    gnd "Fantastico! Non vedo l’ora."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:188
translate italian neighborsure_616126a9:

    # gnd "Let me give you my phone number."
    gnd "Lascia che ti dia il mio numero di telefono."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:189
translate italian neighborsure_ec3ea59f:

    # pc "Well, I don't have a phone right now. I sort of left in a hurry and forgot the thing in Brazil. I even had to call an Uber from a pay phone."
    pc "Beh, al momento non ho il cellulare. Sono partito un po’ di fretta e l’ho dimenticato in Brasile. Ho persino dovuto chiamare un Uber da un telefono pubblico."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:190
translate italian neighborsure_4d9a5c08:

    # gnd "Wow, I didn't even know you could do that."
    gnd "Wow, non sapevo nemmeno che si potesse fare."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:191
translate italian neighborsure_07ae5ff4:

    # gnd "Well, you know where I live anyways. Just come over and see me sometime."
    gnd "Beh, comunque sai dove abito. Passa a trovarmi qualche volta."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:192
translate italian neighborsure_bf344fc1:

    # pc "I'll be sure to do that."
    pc "Lo farò sicuramente."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:193
translate italian neighborsure_3ea1fb42:

    # gnd "Okay, I'll let you get back to what you were doing. It's really good to see you again, [pcname]."
    gnd "Ok, ti lascio tornare a quello che stavi facendo. È stato davvero bello rivederti, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:194
translate italian neighborsure_b59564bf:

    # pc "Good to see you too. Talk to you later."
    pc "Anche per me è stato bello vederti. Ci sentiamo più tardi."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:195
translate italian neighborsure_53dafd04:

    # "She smiles and gives me a wave before turning around and walking back inside her house."
    "Sorride e mi fa un cenno con la mano prima di voltarsi e rientrare in casa."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:200
translate italian neighborbusy_af2bb653:

    # "She is unable to hide the disappointment on her face."
    "Non riesce a nascondere la delusione sul suo viso."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:202
translate italian neighborbusy_d41d8cd9:

    # voice "voices/jamie_003.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_003.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:203
translate italian neighborbusy_34e40ec9:

    # gnd "Oh, okay."
    gnd "Oh, va bene."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:204
translate italian neighborbusy_1708b5ad:

    # gnd "Well, if you change your mind, you know where I live."
    gnd "Beh, se cambi idea, sai dove abito."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:205
translate italian neighborbusy_994698a4:

    # gnd "I'll let you get back to what you were doing. It was nice to see you again."
    gnd "Ti lascio tornare a quello che stavi facendo. È stato bello rivederti."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:208
translate italian neighborbusy_4d48c356:

    # "She puts on an obviously fake smile and gives me a short wave before quickly turning around and walking back inside her house."
    "Lei sfoggia un sorriso palesemente finto e mi fa un breve cenno con la mano prima di voltarsi rapidamente e rientrare in casa."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:215
translate italian dinner_6bf7ca74:

    # "I hear a car pull into the driveway and the door shut. Must be Suzy."
    "Sento un’auto entrare nel vialetto e la porta chiudersi. Dev’essere Suzy."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:216
translate italian dinner_15d46ed4:

    # "It's a bit strange to think of her driving. She'd been fifteen years old when I left and most of the time I had to drive her everywhere."
    "È un po’ strano immaginarla alla guida. Aveva quindici anni quando me ne sono andato e la maggior parte delle volte dovevo accompagnarla io ovunque."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:217
translate italian dinner_0530e225:

    # "Now, I might need her to drive me. Until I can get a car at least. How the hell am I going to get a car?"
    "Ora, potrei aver bisogno che sia lei a portarmi in giro. Almeno finché non riuscirò a procurarmi un’auto. Come diavolo farò a procurarmi un’auto?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:223
translate italian dinner_a0b77eb0:

    # "I walk back inside and see Lisa and Suzy standing at the front door. Suzy looks over at me with an expression that I can't decipher."
    "Rientro in casa e vedo Lisa e Suzy in piedi davanti alla porta d’ingresso. Suzy mi lancia uno sguardo con un’espressione che non riesco a decifrare."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:224
translate italian dinner_536ca09a:

    # "Is she happy to see me, or upset, or just surprised?"
    "È felice di vedermi, o arrabbiata, o semplicemente sorpresa?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:225
translate italian dinner_b9a34438:

    # "She looks a lot different than the last time I had seen her. Not a child anymore. All grown up."
    "Sembra molto diversa dall’ultima volta che l’ho vista. Non è più una bambina. È cresciuta."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:249
translate italian dinner_b9085ed0:

    # sp "There he is now."
    sp "Eccolo lì."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:250
translate italian dinner_f3bfb9f9:

    # pc "Hey, [sis]."
    pc "Ehi, [sis]."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:254
translate italian dinner_d41d8cd9:

    # voice 'voices/suzy_hey1.mp3'
    voice 'voices/suzy_hey1.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:255
translate italian dinner_f4685411:

    # ss "Hey."
    ss "Ehi."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:258
translate italian dinner_266752d5:

    # "She turns back towards Lisa."
    "Si gira verso Lisa."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:259
translate italian dinner_099bdf34:

    # ss "So what's for dinner?"
    ss "Allora, cosa c’è per cena?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:262
translate italian dinner_6adaf09c:

    # sp "That's it? Hey, what's for dinner?"
    sp "Tutto qui? Ehi, cosa c’è per cena?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:263
translate italian dinner_d377dbd3:

    # sp "You haven't seen [pcname] in three years. At least give him a hug or something."
    sp "Non vedi [pcname] da tre anni. Almeno dagli un abbraccio o qualcosa del genere."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:266
translate italian dinner_7d526f5b:

    # ss "Do you want a hug, [bro]?"
    ss "Vuoi un abbraccio, [bro]?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:273
translate italian hugno_1843469a:

    # pc "I mean you don't have to."
    pc "Cioè, non sei obbligata."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:275
translate italian hugno_67e29172:

    # ss "Good. I smell dinner. Let's eat, I'm starving!"
    ss "Bene. Sento il profumo della cena. Mangiamo, muoio di fame!"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:279
translate italian hugno_73d3290c:

    # sp "Suzy!"
    sp "Suzy!"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:280
translate italian hugno_6f0bb30f:

    # ss "He said I don't have to. Not everybody is a hugger mom. Respect people's boundaries."
    ss "Ha detto che non sono obbligata. Non tutti sono tipi da abbracci, mamma. Rispetta i limiti delle persone."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:281
translate italian hugno_672d419d:

    # sp "I can't believe you."
    sp "Non riesco a crederci."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:284
translate italian hugyes_0fdda645:

    # pc "We probably should, right?"
    pc "Probabilmente dovremmo, vero?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:287
translate italian hugyes_b52b7bc9:

    # ss "I guess."
    ss "Immagino di sì."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:291
translate italian hugyes_627ce8ab:

    # "She hesitantly walks towards me and lightly puts her arms around me, barely touching."
    "Si avvicina esitante verso di me e mi cinge leggermente con le braccia, sfiorandomi appena."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:292
translate italian hugyes_e1fa87a8:

    # pc "It's good to see you, [sis]."
    pc "È bello vederti, [sis]."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:293
translate italian hugyes_3caba330:

    # ss "Good to see you too."
    ss "Anche per me è bello vederti."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:294
translate italian hugyes_a2f7fa6a:

    # "Then she quickly pulls away."
    "Poi si allontana rapidamente."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:300
translate italian hugyes_78d5d1d8:

    # ss "Alright, we hugged, let's eat, I'm starving!"
    ss "Va bene, ci siamo abbracciati, mangiamo, sto morendo di fame!"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:305
translate italian dinner2_4f4f66ba:

    # "We make our plates in the kitchen and bring them to the small four-person table in the dining room."
    "Prepariamo i piatti in cucina e li portiamo al piccolo tavolo da quattro nella sala da pranzo."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:306
translate italian dinner2_a501017d:

    # "Lisa had made chicken fried steak and mashed potatoes with gravy, along with creamed spinach and dinner rolls."
    "Lisa aveva preparato una bistecca di pollo fritta e purè di patate con sugo, insieme a spinaci alla panna e panini."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:307
translate italian dinner2_a4109bc0:

    # "I'm not a big fan of spinach, but everything else looks delicious."
    "Non vado pazza per gli spinaci, ma tutto il resto sembra delizioso."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:308
translate italian dinner2_82b4d135:

    # ss "Thanks for cooking Mom. This is amazing!"
    ss "Grazie per aver cucinato, mamma. È fantastico!"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:309
translate italian dinner2_132b8415:

    # sp "Amazing might be a strong word. [pcname] has been down in Brazil for the last three years. I bet they have some real amazing food down there, right?"
    sp "“Fantastico” potrebbe essere una parola un po’ forte. [pcname] è stata in Brasile negli ultimi tre anni. Scommetto che laggiù il cibo è davvero fantastico, vero?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:316
translate italian amazingtacos_d1df5759:

    # pc "No, she's right. These are perfect."
    pc "No, ha ragione lei. Queste sono perfette."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:317
translate italian amazingtacos_ac97708c:

    # pc "The food in Brazil was great, but there's something about a good homemade chicken fried steak that makes it really feel like I'm home again."
    pc "Il cibo in Brasile era ottimo, ma c’è qualcosa in una buona bistecca di pollo impanata fatta in casa che mi fa sentire davvero di nuovo a casa."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:320
translate italian amazingtacos_b2a06636:

    # sp "I'm glad you like it, and I'm glad that you're home."
    sp "Sono contenta che ti piaccia e sono contenta che tu sia a casa."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:323
translate italian mehtacos_bbafcb97:

    # pc "Yeah, this is nowhere near as good as the empanadas down there."
    pc "Sì, non è neanche lontanamente buono come le empanadas laggiù."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:326
translate italian mehtacos_984cd73b:

    # sp "See, this is just cheap steak, breaded and fried. Not exactly gourmet cooking."
    sp "Vedi, questa è solo una bistecca da quattro soldi, impanata e fritta. Non è proprio cucina gourmet."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:327
translate italian mehtacos_b89e34ff:

    # "Suzy glared at me and shook her head."
    "Suzy mi lanciò un'occhiataccia e scosse la testa."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:332
translate italian dinner3_e9cd228e:

    # ss "So why are you back anyways?"
    ss "Allora, perché sei tornato comunque?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:335
translate italian dinner3_900dc08e:

    # sp "Be nice."
    sp "Sii gentile."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:336
translate italian dinner3_ed0bffd1:

    # ss "I am being nice. It's just a question."
    ss "Lo sono. È solo una domanda."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:337
translate italian dinner3_d0083d8d:

    # pc "I came back to help find my dad."
    pc "Sono tornato per aiutare a trovare mio padre."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:338
translate italian dinner3_92f7529c:

    # ss "Well good luck with that. He ran off with another woman. If he wanted to be found, we would've already found him."
    ss "Beh, buona fortuna. È scappato con un'altra donna. Se avesse voluto farsi trovare, lo avremmo già trovato."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:341
translate italian dinner3_06a83c9b:

    # sp "Stop."
    sp "Smettila."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:342
translate italian dinner3_447f8572:

    # sp "Don't talk about him like that. Just stop."
    sp "Non parlare di lui in quel modo. Smettila e basta."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:343
translate italian dinner3_95ae9b92:

    # ss "Sorry Mom."
    ss "Scusa, mamma."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:346
translate italian dinner3_d95dc3cd:

    # sp "I don't want to argue at the table. Let's just have a nice dinner and we can talk about your father tomorrow."
    sp "Non voglio litigare a tavola. Godiamoci una bella cena e di tuo padre ne parleremo domani."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:347
translate italian dinner3_74555258:

    # "We sit in silence for a few minutes, eating, not saying anything. "
    "Restiamo seduti in silenzio per qualche minuto, mangiando, senza dire nulla. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:348
translate italian dinner3_9ecbea22:

    # "I want to ask more. I want to know why she thought my dad would have run off with another woman. But Lisa is obviously upset, and I don't want to start a fight. "
    "Vorrei chiedere di più. Vorrei sapere perché pensava che mio padre fosse scappato con un’altra donna. Ma Lisa è chiaramente turbata e non voglio scatenare una lite. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:351
translate italian dinner3_f1c7cb27:

    # sp "How long are you planning on staying, [pcname]?"
    sp "Quanto pensi di restare, [pcname]?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:352
translate italian dinner3_ab1f2008:

    # pc "I'm back permanently. "
    pc "Sono tornata definitivamente. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:353
translate italian dinner3_2441805f:

    # sp "What? You're not going back to school? "
    sp "Cosa? Non torni a scuola? "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:354
translate italian dinner3_4f22cfa1:

    # pc "I can't. The scholarship was for four years, but if I miss any time, the scholarship is revoked. School started two days ago. I won't be able to go back. "
    pc "Non posso. La borsa di studio era per quattro anni, ma se perdo anche solo un giorno di lezione, me la revocano. La scuola è iniziata due giorni fa. Non potrò più tornare. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:356
translate italian dinner3_eb965744:

    # sp "Oh no! I wouldn't have wanted you to come if I'd known that! Your father wouldn't have wanted you to give up school to help find him either!"
    sp "Oh no! Se l’avessi saputo, non avrei voluto che venissi! Neanche tuo padre avrebbe voluto che rinunciassi agli studi per aiutarlo a trovarlo!"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:357
translate italian dinner3_3c14b8e8:

    # pc "It's done. I wanted to come back. I wasn't doing great at school anyways. I'm not sure I would've made it through the next year. "
    pc "Ormai è fatta. Volevo tornare. A scuola non andavo granché bene comunque. Non sono sicura che sarei riuscita a superare il prossimo anno. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:358
translate italian dinner3_f36256a6:

    # sp "So what are you going to do then? "
    sp "Allora cosa farai? "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:359
translate italian dinner3_e26eb0c6:

    # pc "I'll go to school here. Finish up my degree and get a job here. That way I can help you out and try to find my dad. "
    pc "Frequenterò la scuola qui. Finirò la laurea e troverò un lavoro qui. Così potrò darti una mano e cercare di ritrovare mio padre. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:360
translate italian dinner3_f98fa327:

    # "Lisa looks like she is about to cry. "
    "Lisa sembra sul punto di piangere. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:362
translate italian dinner3_d41d8cd9:

    # voice 'voices/lisa_sorry2.wav'
    voice 'voices/lisa_sorry2.wav'

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:363
translate italian dinner3_ce872a9f:

    # sp "I'm sorry you had to give all that up. I shouldn't have even sent that e-mail. "
    sp "Mi dispiace che tu abbia dovuto rinunciare a tutto questo. Non avrei nemmeno dovuto mandarti quell’e-mail. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:364
translate italian dinner3_f416188f:

    # pc "It's fine, really. I'm glad you sent it. I want to help, and I like being back. I didn't really have any friends down there. It's hard when you can barely speak the language. "
    pc "Va bene, davvero. Sono contenta che tu l’abbia mandata. Voglio dare una mano, e mi fa piacere essere tornata. Laggiù non avevo proprio nessun amico. È difficile quando riesci a malapena a parlare la lingua. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:365
translate italian dinner3_e31cfdde:

    # pc "And I missed my family. "
    pc "E mi mancava la mia famiglia. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:367
translate italian dinner3_5f7f342a:

    # sp "We missed you too, right Suzy?"
    sp "Anche tu ci sei mancata, vero Suzy?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:369
translate italian dinner3_48c93c5d:

    # ss "Gag me. "
    ss "Che schifo. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:370
translate italian dinner3_081c7332:

    # ss "If you're going to sign up for school, you better do it tomorrow. Registration is closing soon. "
    ss "Se hai intenzione di iscriverti a scuola, faresti meglio a farlo domani. Le iscrizioni chiudono a breve. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:371
translate italian dinner3_038c9ed9:

    # sp "She's right. Suzy, you can give him a ride up to the school in the morning so he can get everything straightened out. "
    sp "Ha ragione. Suzy, puoi dargli un passaggio fino a scuola domani mattina così può sistemare tutto. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:373
translate italian dinner3_c0cf4e1c:

    # ss "Why do I have to give him a ride? "
    ss "Perché devo dargli un passaggio? "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:374
translate italian dinner3_31d1c1eb:

    # sp "Because I have to work and [pcname] just got back to town and doesn't have a car."
    sp "Perché io devo lavorare e [pcname] è appena tornato in città e non ha la macchina."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:375
translate italian dinner3_c6d0a215:

    # sp "AND because I asked you to. "
    sp "E perché te l’ho chiesto io. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:377
translate italian dinner3_7197e500:

    # ss "Okay, fine. Be ready to go at 10 a.m. though. If you're not ready, I'm not taking you. "
    ss "Ok, va bene. Preparati a partire alle 10 del mattino, però. Se non sei pronta, non ti porto. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:378
translate italian dinner3_b0883318:

    # sp "Show him around town too. It's been a while since he's been here."
    sp "Fagli anche fare un giro in città. È da un po’ che non viene qui."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:379
translate italian dinner3_a6b45ae3:

    # ss "Fine, but you need to get a car fast, because I can't be your chauffeur all the time. I have a life, you know."
    ss "Va bene, ma devi procurarti una macchina al più presto, perché non posso farti da autista tutto il tempo. Ho una vita mia, lo sai."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:380
translate italian dinner3_9083962a:

    # pc "You're right. I need to get a car. I need a cell phone too. So I need a job."
    pc "Hai ragione. Devo procurarmi una macchina. Mi serve anche un cellulare. Quindi mi serve un lavoro."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:382
translate italian dinner3_4bee5430:

    # sp "What happened to your cell phone?"
    sp "Che fine ha fatto il tuo cellulare?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:383
translate italian dinner3_0e7d850c:

    # pc "I sort of forgot it in Brazil."
    pc "L’ho tipo dimenticato in Brasile."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:384
translate italian dinner3_fcf63dc9:

    # sp "Oh no!"
    sp "Oh no!"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:385
translate italian dinner3_706f59f6:

    # pc "No big deal. I'll get another, but I need money for that."
    pc "Niente di grave. Me ne comprerò un altro, ma mi servono i soldi per farlo."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:386
translate italian dinner3_fe6322c5:

    # sp "It seems they're always looking for administrative assistants at the law offices downtown. I'm sure you could do that, with how smart you are. "
    sp "Sembra che gli studi legali in centro cerchino sempre assistenti amministrativi. Sono sicura che potresti farlo, visto quanto sei intelligente. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:388
translate italian dinner3_b7e8d5cc:

    # ss "Who says he's so smart?"
    ss "Chi dice che sia così intelligente?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:389
translate italian dinner3_905e17eb:

    # sp "He qualified for that college in Brazil on a full scholarship. "
    sp "È stato ammesso a quell’università in Brasile con una borsa di studio completa. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:390
translate italian dinner3_1232931d:

    # ss "Yeah, and then flunked out of it apparently. "
    ss "Sì, e poi a quanto pare è stato bocciato. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:392
translate italian dinner3_9a859b5f:

    # sp "Be nice! "
    sp "Sii gentile! "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:393
translate italian dinner3_eac3f948:

    # "Suzy rolls her eyes. "
    "Suzy alza gli occhi al cielo. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:395
translate italian dinner3_cd1c0018:

    # sp "Anyway, I was going to say, you could use your father's car, if we could find the key."
    sp "Comunque, stavo per dire che potresti usare l’auto di tuo padre, se riuscissimo a trovare la chiave."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:396
translate italian dinner3_fb35da6b:

    # sp "I'm not sure where he put it. I couldn't find it in his dresser and I didn't touch much down in the basement before the police locked it up."
    sp "Non so bene dove l’abbia messa. Non sono riuscita a trovarla nel suo comò e non ho guardato molto in cantina prima che la polizia la chiudesse a chiave."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:397
translate italian dinner3_602ba288:

    # sp "I haven't even seen him drive it in at least a month."
    sp "Non lo vedo guidare quell’auto da almeno un mese."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:398
translate italian dinner3_3c301d5a:

    # pc "Okay, I'll check it out sometime."
    pc "Ok, darò un’occhiata prima o poi."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:401
translate italian dinner3_3dbf05d8:

    # ss "I'm done. I'm going up to my room."
    ss "Ho finito. Vado in camera mia."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:402
translate italian dinner3_f3968cc8:

    # ss "Be ready at 10 tomorrow [bro]."
    ss "Preparati per domani alle 10 [bro]."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:403
translate italian dinner3_0da1b457:

    # "With that she rushes out of the dining room and up the stairs. "
    "Detto questo, si precipita fuori dalla sala da pranzo e su per le scale. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:406
translate italian dinner3_e9cab60e:

    # sp "You'll have to excuse her. She's probably just going to talk to her boyfriend."
    sp "Devi scusarla. Probabilmente sta solo andando a parlare con il suo ragazzo."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:407
translate italian dinner3_3a98b7ff:

    # sp "She does this almost every night. He lives in Whiterock and they hardly ever get to see each other anymore, so they talk on the phone a lot. "
    sp "Lo fa quasi tutte le sere. Lui vive a Whiterock e ormai riescono a vedersi pochissimo, quindi parlano molto al telefono. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:408
translate italian dinner3_c969083e:

    # sp "Try to get along with her, okay?"
    sp "Cerca di andare d’accordo con lei, ok?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:409
translate italian dinner3_cfc6d9f8:

    # sp "She may not show it, but she is really upset over your father. She loves him and misses him too. "
    sp "Forse non lo dà a vedere, ma è davvero sconvolta per la storia di tuo padre. Gli vuole bene e le manca tantissimo. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:410
translate italian dinner3_856a2ed5:

    # sp "And even though she'd probably never tell you, I know she missed you as well. "
    sp "E anche se probabilmente non te lo direbbe mai, so che le mancavi anche tu. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:411
translate italian dinner3_54567235:

    # sp "She was different after you left. Quieter and sullen. Lonely, I think. "
    sp "Era diversa dopo che te ne sei andata. Più silenziosa e cupa. Solitaria, credo. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:412
translate italian dinner3_02d1dafd:

    # sp "I know you two didn't hang out much, but I think she liked that you were always there to have her back. When you left, I think she felt a little abandoned. "
    sp "So che voi due non vi frequentavate molto, ma penso che le piacesse il fatto che tu fossi sempre lì a sostenerla. Quando te ne sei andata, credo che si sia sentita un po’ abbandonata. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:413
translate italian dinner3_2aec8af1:

    # "I never thought about that really. I didn't have a close relationship with Suzy, but we didn't fight really either. I was mad at my dad when I left, and resentful towards Lisa and Suzy for taking him away from me. "
    "Non ci avevo mai pensato davvero. Non avevo un rapporto stretto con Suzy, ma non litigavamo nemmeno, in realtà. Quando me ne sono andata ero arrabbiata con mio padre e provavo risentimento verso Lisa e Suzy per avermelo portato via. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:414
translate italian dinner3_9b39d1de:

    # "I never really gave them a chance. "
    "Non ho mai dato loro una vera possibilità. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:415
translate italian dinner3_4270ba94:

    # pc "I'm sorry for how I acted before I left. I've done a lot of growing up since then. I shouldn't have treated you and Suzy like I did. "
    pc "Mi dispiace per come mi sono comportata prima di andarmene. Da allora sono maturata molto. Non avrei dovuto trattare te e Suzy in quel modo. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:417
translate italian dinner3_f468cec8:

    # sp "Oh, you are beyond forgiven. You were a teenager. I get it. "
    sp "Oh, sei più che perdonata. Eri un’adolescente. Lo capisco. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:418
translate italian dinner3_e1c5605f:

    # sp "Your dad understood too. He was never upset at you. "
    sp "Anche tuo padre lo capiva. Non si è mai arrabbiato con te. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:419
translate italian dinner3_983990a9:

    # pc "I wish he was here. "
    pc "Vorrei che fosse qui. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:421
translate italian dinner3_b9c6a980:

    # sp "Me too."
    sp "Anch’io."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:424
translate italian dinner3_f2041521:

    # "I stand up next to her and give her a hug, holding her close. "
    "Mi avvicino a lei e le do un abbraccio, stringendola forte. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:426
translate italian dinner3_d41d8cd9_1:

    # voice 'voices/lisa_iloveyou2.wav'
    voice 'voices/lisa_iloveyou2.wav'

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:427
translate italian dinner3_dbd4b8fb:

    # sp "I love you."
    sp "Ti voglio bene."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:428
translate italian dinner3_931fdb2e:

    # pc "I love you too, Lisa."
    pc "Anch’io ti voglio bene, Lisa."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:430
translate italian dishes_90fef3a5:

    # pc "I'll get the dishes, okay?"
    pc "Vado a lavare i piatti, ok?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:431
translate italian dishes_cdac8c69:

    # sp "Oh you don't have to do that. I'll get them."
    sp "Oh, non devi farlo. Ci penso io."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:432
translate italian dishes_8c3d6761:

    # pc "It's okay. You fed me, it's the least I can do."
    pc "Va bene così. Mi hai preparato da mangiare, è il minimo che possa fare."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:435
translate italian dishes_631bfdab:

    # "I pick up the empty plates from the table and carry them into the kitchen, setting them into the sink."
    "Raccolgo i piatti vuoti dal tavolo e li porto in cucina, mettendoli nel lavello."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:438
translate italian dishes_96b0df67:

    # "Then I start washing dishes while she puts what little leftovers there are into storage containers and into the refrigerator."
    "Poi inizio a lavare i piatti mentre lei mette i pochi avanzi rimasti in contenitori ermetici e li ripone in frigorifero."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:439
translate italian dishes_9d9933cd:

    # sp "You don't have to do all of them, [pcname]. Some of those dishes are from a few days ago."
    sp "Non devi lavarli tutti, [pcname]. Alcuni di quei piatti risalgono a qualche giorno fa."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:440
translate italian dishes_e9dbfb00:

    # pc "It's no problem, really. I don't mind."
    pc "Non è un problema, davvero. Non mi dispiace."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:441
translate italian dishes_92402374:

    # "I scrub the dishes and put them away into the dishwasher. She's right. It seems the dishes have been piling in the sink for a few days. It's mostly coffee cups and silverware though."
    "Strofino i piatti e li metto nella lavastoviglie. Ha ragione. Sembra che i piatti si siano accumulati nel lavandino da qualche giorno. Per lo più sono tazze da caffè e posate, però."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:442
translate italian dishes_e91f1694:

    # "While I do the dishes, Lisa wipes off the counter and the stove, then comes over and stands next to me, watching and smiling."
    "Mentre lavo i piatti, Lisa pulisce il piano di lavoro e i fornelli, poi si avvicina e si ferma accanto a me, guardandomi e sorridendo."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:445
translate italian dishes_688415e5:

    # sp "It's so great having you back home."
    sp "È fantastico riaverti a casa."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:446
translate italian dishes_8ba74747:

    # sp "And not just to help out with the chores."
    sp "E non solo per dare una mano con le faccende domestiche."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:447
translate italian dishes_be5f85fa:

    # sp "Look at you. You're all grown up now. You turned out to be such a great person."
    sp "Ma guardati. Sei cresciuta ormai. Sei diventata una persona davvero fantastica."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:448
translate italian dishes_0621a10e:

    # sp "I'm proud of you, [pcname]."
    sp "Sono orgogliosa di te, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:449
translate italian dishes_419a081b:

    # pc "Thanks, Lisa."
    pc "Grazie, Lisa."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:450
translate italian dishes_2e22a4be:

    # sp "You don't have to call me by my first name, you know."
    sp "Non devi chiamarmi per nome, lo sai."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:451
translate italian dishes_49c20c2a:

    # sp "Isn't there something else you'd rather call me?"
    sp "Non c’è qualcos’altro con cui preferiresti chiamarmi?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:464
translate italian dishes_255098d6:

    # pc "I guess I could call you [mom]."
    pc "Immagino che potrei chiamarti [mom]."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:465
translate italian dishes_fe663261:

    # "She smiles and rubs my back with one hand."
    "Lei sorride e mi accarezza la schiena con una mano."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:466
translate italian dishes_74fbfcd0:

    # sp "I like that."
    sp "Mi piace."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:469
translate italian notreadymom_1d99098b:

    # sp "I understand, but I hope you will be some day."
    sp "Capisco, ma spero che un giorno lo sarai."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:474
translate italian dishesdone_e3f22ce7:

    # "It only takes about ten minutes to finish the dishes, then I start the dishwasher and dry off my hands."
    "Ci vogliono solo una decina di minuti per finire di lavare i piatti, poi accendo la lavastoviglie e mi asciugo le mani."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:477
translate italian dishesdone_0600f8f0:

    # sp "Thank you so much for the help."
    sp "Grazie mille per l’aiuto."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:478
translate italian dishesdone_aaa5ef92:

    # pc "It's no problem at all. I'll try to help you more around the house too."
    pc "Non c’è alcun problema. Cercherò di aiutarti di più anche in casa."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:479
translate italian dishesdone_6d09b2a0:

    # sp "I could definitely use it. Between looking for your father and having to work all the time, I just don't seem to have enough time in the day."
    sp "Ne avrei decisamente bisogno. Tra la ricerca di tuo padre e il dover lavorare tutto il tempo, mi sembra proprio di non avere abbastanza tempo nella giornata."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:482
translate italian bedtime_108b39c6:

    # pc "I'm getting pretty tired. I should probably go get ready for bed. It sounds like I have a big day tomorrow."
    pc "Sono piuttosto stanco. Probabilmente dovrei andare a prepararmi per andare a letto. Sembra che domani mi aspetti una giornata impegnativa."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:483
translate italian bedtime_35fcb529:

    # sp "Oh you're right, it is getting late."
    sp "Oh, hai ragione, si sta facendo tardi."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:484
translate italian bedtime_37eafefd:

    # sp "Your bed should be made up, but let me know if you need anything else."
    sp "Il tuo letto dovrebbe essere già fatto, ma fammi sapere se hai bisogno di qualcos’altro."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:485
translate italian bedtime_34bcfe10:

    # pc "I should be good. Thanks. "
    pc "Dovrei essere a posto. Grazie. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:486
translate italian bedtime_39e280b3:

    # sp "You're welcome. Goodnight honey. "
    sp "Non c’è di che. Buonanotte, tesoro. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:490
translate italian bedtime_cb73fb79:

    # "I start walking up the stairs, but stop when she calls up after me."
    "Comincio a salire le scale, ma mi fermo quando mi chiama da sopra."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:491
translate italian bedtime_d7236e30:

    # sp "Hey."
    sp "Ehi."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:493
translate italian bedtime_ac8e7326:

    # sp "I'm so glad you're home. "
    sp "Sono così felice che tu sia a casa. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:494
translate italian bedtime_0e1f6f09:

    # pc "I'm glad to be home. "
    pc "Sono felice di essere a casa. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:495
translate italian bedtime_c2eac4d5:

    # "And surprisingly, that is true. I had been nervous the entire way here, but now it is starting to feel like home again. I've missed this place and these people. "
    "E, sorprendentemente, è vero. Sono stata nervosa per tutto il tragitto, ma ora comincio a sentirmi di nuovo a casa. Mi sono mancati questo posto e queste persone. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:496
translate italian bedtime_8988551c:

    # "And I am excited to get my life started again. "
    "E non vedo l’ora di ricominciare la mia vita. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:499
translate italian bedtime_a9cb4b72:

    # "I walk up and go into my bedroom, closing the door behind me."
    "Salgo e entro nella mia camera da letto, chiudendo la porta dietro di me."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:502
translate italian bedtime_34780e18:

    # "I can't help but think of all the things that I need to do."
    "Non posso fare a meno di pensare a tutte le cose che devo fare."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:503
translate italian bedtime_78eef5f3:

    # "Register for college, find a job, get a car, get a phone. "
    "Iscrivermi all’università, trovare un lavoro, comprarmi un’auto, procurarmi un cellulare. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:504
translate italian bedtime_733bb6e8:

    # "And maybe most important of all, I need to find out what happened to my dad."
    "E forse, cosa più importante di tutte, devo scoprire cosa è successo a mio padre."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:505
translate italian bedtime_dea2a7f7:

    # "Something catches my attention from the corner of my eye. There is a clear view between my window and the window in the house next door. Jamie's window. "
    "Qualcosa attira la mia attenzione con la coda dell’occhio. C’è una visuale libera tra la mia finestra e quella della casa accanto. La finestra di Jamie. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:509
translate italian bedtime_2b3df239:

    # "Her curtains are open, and I see her moving around in her bedroom."
    "Le sue tende sono aperte e la vedo muoversi nella sua camera da letto."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:510
translate italian bedtime_d26fe3f6:

    # "She is dressed for bed and dancing a little to some music that I can't hear. "
    "È in pigiama e balla un po’ al ritmo di una musica che non riesco a sentire. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:517
translate italian keepwatchingjamie0_b1acde04:

    # "I stand there watching. This isn't the first time that this had happened. I remember back when I was a teenager, watching her through this same window."
    "Me ne sto lì a guardarla. Non è la prima volta che succede. Ricordo che, quando ero adolescente, la guardavo proprio da questa stessa finestra."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:518
translate italian keepwatchingjamie0_829b69aa:

    # "Sometimes I could catch quite the show."
    "A volte riuscivo a godermi uno spettacolo niente male."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:519
translate italian keepwatchingjamie0_f4cd189f:

    # "She dances around a little longer, looking quite nice in her t-shirt and short shorts."
    "Continua a ballare ancora un po’, davvero carina con la sua maglietta e i pantaloncini cortissimi."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:522
translate italian keepwatchingjamie0_a9d11f9b:

    # "Then she looks right up at me. I am caught!"
    "Poi alza lo sguardo proprio verso di me. Mi ha beccato!"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:523
translate italian keepwatchingjamie0_416b1742:

    # "I start to turn around, pretend that I hadn't seen anything. That I hadn't been watching."
    "Comincio a voltarmi, fingendo di non aver visto nulla. Di non averla guardata."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:526
translate italian keepwatchingjamie0_015e93e4:

    # "But she just smiles and waves."
    "Ma lei si limita a sorridere e a salutarmi con la mano."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:527
translate italian keepwatchingjamie0_4f3a3ee4:

    # "I wave back."
    "Ricambio il saluto."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:530
translate italian keepwatchingjamie0_47c7c917:

    # "Then she walks over to the window and closes the curtain."
    "Poi si avvicina alla finestra e chiude la tenda."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:531
translate italian keepwatchingjamie0_a0ca000d:

    # "Show's over folks, time to go to bed."
    "Lo spettacolo è finito, gente, è ora di andare a letto."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:536
translate italian stopwatchingjamie0_9d8f3e71:

    # "I shouldn't be watching. That's a pretty creepy thing to do."
    "Non dovrei stare a guardare. È una cosa piuttosto inquietante da fare."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:537
translate italian stopwatchingjamie0_157d17b0:

    # "I turn away and try not to think about what I might be missing."
    "Mi volto dall’altra parte e cerco di non pensare a ciò che potrei perdermi."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:540
translate italian getreadyforbed_e8de2125:

    # "I take my toothbrush from my suitcase and open the door that leads into the bathroom between Suzy's room and my room."
    "Prendo lo spazzolino da denti dalla valigia e apro la porta che conduce al bagno tra la stanza di Suzy e la mia."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:543
translate italian getreadyforbed_758405dc:

    # "The door that leads into her bedroom is open and I see her lying on the bed in her night clothes, talking into her cell phone. "
    "La porta che conduce alla sua camera da letto è aperta e la vedo sdraiata sul letto in pigiama, mentre parla al cellulare. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:545
translate italian getreadyforbed_d1f1872b:

    # "She gives me an annoyed look."
    "Mi lancia uno sguardo infastidito."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:547
translate italian getreadyforbed_d41d8cd9:

    # voice 'voices/suzy_day0_1.mp3'
    voice 'voices/suzy_day0_1.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:548
translate italian getreadyforbed_9fef9570:

    # ss "Ugh! Are you going to shut the door or just stand there staring at me like a pervert?"
    ss "Uffa! Hai intenzione di chiudere la porta o di restare lì a fissarmi come un pervertito?"

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:549
translate italian getreadyforbed_b2395364:

    # pc "Sorry."
    pc "Scusa."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:552
translate italian getreadyforbed_1698b2b6:

    # "I shut the door quickly, giving both of us our privacy."
    "Chiudo rapidamente la porta, garantendo a entrambi un po’ di privacy."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:553
translate italian getreadyforbed_44d2215b:

    # "This is going to take some getting used to."
    "Ci vorrà un po’ per abituarmi."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:554
translate italian getreadyforbed_3e0e7e7e:

    # "I turn to the sink. It is all covered with her things."
    "Mi giro verso il lavandino. È tutto coperto dalle sue cose."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:555
translate italian getreadyforbed_6c8adbe6:

    # "I find the toothpaste among the clutter of hair products and makeup and brush my teeth, then clear out a place for me to keep my toothbrush."
    "Trovo il dentifricio tra il disordine di prodotti per capelli e trucchi e mi lavo i denti, poi faccio spazio per mettere il mio spazzolino."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:556
translate italian getreadyforbed_ccb610d3:

    # "I've been gone for three years. I hate to just come back and force her to make room for me, but I am going to need some space in here as well if we have to share this bathroom."
    "Sono stato via per tre anni. Odio tornare e costringerla a farmi spazio, ma avrò bisogno di un po’ di spazio anche qui se dobbiamo condividere questo bagno."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:557
translate italian getreadyforbed_fbfe7d80:

    # "With that done, I head to bed."
    "Fatto questo, vado a letto."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:560
translate italian getreadyforbed_ce296358:

    # "The bed is soft. Even more so than I remember. And the sheets smell like home."
    "Il letto è morbido. Ancora più di quanto ricordassi. E le lenzuola profumano di casa."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:561
translate italian getreadyforbed_ada2c3fb:

    # "All of this just feels so comforting. It is strange. At first, I had been worried that you could never go home again. That this would all be too different, and I wouldn't fit in here anymore. "
    "Tutto questo mi dà una sensazione così rassicurante. È strano. All’inizio temevo che non sarei mai più potuta tornare a casa. Che tutto sarebbe stato troppo diverso e che non mi sarei più sentita a mio agio qui. "

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:562
translate italian getreadyforbed_639a54c3:

    # "Now though. Now I feel good about all of it. I feel like I am home for the first time in a long time."
    "Adesso però. Adesso mi sento bene con tutto questo. Mi sento a casa per la prima volta dopo tanto tempo."

# game/Scenes/Prologue/day0.rpy:563
translate italian getreadyforbed_f4f9d6d2:

    # "Just one thing is missing – Dad."
    "Manca solo una cosa: papà."

